          ]
        },
        {
          "fact_id": "f2",
          "text": "For Yuan Zeqiang, with three and a half years of sell-side research, his two debut portfolios at Caitong Fund Management tumbled 36 per cent and 33 per cent, respectively, between his June 11 appointment and July 30, market data showed.",
          "source_id": "source:primary",
          "captured_at": "2026-08-15T09:56:20.997882+08:00",
          "content_sha256": "fc92e50b8a38a1ad0fa421cdaba806130cd5db13fd1aecedfa10b4f66724f9dd",
          "excerpt": "For Yuan Zeqiang, with three and a half years of sell-side research, his two debut portfolios at Caitong Fund Management tumbled 36 per cent and 33 per cent, respectively, between his June 11 appointment and July 30, market data showed.",
