          "text": "Taking over two products from the outset, Yuan inherited combined assets of 7.28 billion yuan (US$1.08 billion) at the end of the second quarter – an unusually large mandate for a first-time manager.",
          "source_id": "source:primary",
          "captured_at": "2026-08-15T09:56:20.997916+08:00",
